        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\binom{6}{3}=20$",
          "worked": "Fix a success in the last position. The remaining 6 positions contain 3 successes and 3 failures.\n$$\\begin{aligned}N&=\\binom{6}{3}\\\\&=\\frac{6!}{3!3!}\\\\&=20\\end{aligned}$$",
